WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.010
Before the fifteen thirties,

2
00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:05.270
the Pope in Rome is head
of the Church in England.

3
00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:07.890
Then King Henry the Eighth
wants to end his marriage,

4
00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.750
so he can marry again.

5
00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.550
The Pope refuses.

6
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.270
So in fifteen thirty-four,
Parliament makes the king,

7
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.090
not the Pope, head of
the Church of England.

8
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.390
It sounds simple.

9
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:23.250
But was this break with Rome
really just about a divorce?

10
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.090
In this mission, you'll
see the monasteries closed,

11
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.530
and religion swing back and
forth with each new monarch.

12
00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:33.610
And you'll watch a great Spanish
fleet sail against England.

13
00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:38.020
Your mission: decide what really
drove Henry's break with Rome.
